## Getting Started

```bash
npm install
npm start        # nx serve {{ model.manifest.service_name }}
npm test         # nx test {{ model.manifest.service_name }}
npm run build    # nx build {{ model.manifest.service_name }}
npm run lint     # nx lint {{ model.manifest.service_name }}
```

